  "name": "E38 · topic index · 141.5M (120.8M core)",
  "description": "E38 arm lsa — topic index, 150M leaderboard size (m120t); Hub id Meridian21Lab/topic-index-140m-11.5bt. New against e37_lsa_m100: Latent Sparse Attention (Kubicek et al.; our port, as in E33p and E37) at the 150M leaderboard size (m120t): 13 layers (2 more stacked), FFN 2,816, the SmolLM2 vocabulary (49,152), the output tied to the input table through one 896 → 384 projection. Protocol (E38 leaderboard recipe): 11.5B tokens of m21mix_v2 (SmolLM2 tokens): 8.0B in rows of 4,096, then 3.0B at 16,384, then 0.5B at 65,536; 128 rows of 4k per step (32 of 16k, 8 of 64k); Muon from one peak (0.01; the 64k phase at a tenth) with AdamW; one 4 × L40S AWS node per model. Trunk (as the trainer builds m120t): L0–L2 local (window 128), L3 the reading layer, L4 local; [L3, L4] run 4 times with shared weights and a per-round embedding; then L5–L12 local; RoPE θ 500k except on L7 and L11 (every 4th stacked layer); U-net skips L5→L7, L4→L8, L3→L9, L2→L10, L1→L11, L0→L12 (one scalar each, zero at the start); 14 query heads × 64, 1 key/value head, QK norm; SwiGLU 2,816; logits = (h·Pᵀ)·Eᵀ with P [384 × 896] the head's only weights (0.34M instead of an untied head's 44M), softcap 30, z-loss 1e-4. Built 2026-11-21; status released (as of 2026-11-21). Public on the Hugging Face Hub since 2026-11-18. Read: buckets of ~8 similar keys per closed 512-key block, a query opens the best buckets (512 keys) + 4 sinks + its last 512 tokens. Spec: docs/experiments_specs/ahead/E38_long_budget_mix.md. Source: origin/dev @ 99d808a7. Not a builder field: The bucket index and the choice have no weights and no gradient: a 0-parameter custom cell carries their FLOPs; the read is drawn as a 1,028-key window. The run setup shows 4 × H100 (the builder has no L40S preset) and one optimizer, Muon (the trainer pairs Muon with AdamW). The phase lengths 16k and 64k are not part of the run setup (it shows the 4k phase). Parameters: 141,506,208 in total, 120,795,936 without the word tables (input embedding 20,366,208 + output layer 344,064); exact against the trainer's own count (scripts/run_e33n.py count() on fit(\"lsa\", \"m120t\") — FFN 2816 as set, the trainer's factory on the meta device with the SmolLM2 vocabulary of 49,152: the total with non_embedding=False, the core is count()'s default; the tied table is counted once, in the input embedding).",
